Subject: [PATCH] Documentation of the real_type DSL option

The release notes of version 5.2 describe the real_type DSL option
(macros, exported size of the numerical type, shifted versions, refused
interfaces and models, MTest, bounds of the convergence criteria and of
the perturbation of the numerical jacobian with float, assignment of
floating-point expressions, coefficients representable in float). The
pages of the generic and generic-parallel interfaces give a summary.
